--- Texture management singleton class
-- @classmod RageTextureManager
-- @alias TEXTUREMAN

--- Get a RageTexture handle based on the given base64 String.
-- This can arbitrarily load images from data. However, if you try to load garbage, you get an error and a pink texture.
-- @tparam string base64String A base64 String representing an image, not a gif.
-- @treturn RageTexture A RageTexture which might be nil or pink if an error occurs.
function TEXTUREMAN:RageTextureFromBase64(base64String)
end